WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:02.549
I've been building a small project called

00:00:02.549 --> 00:00:03.327
Office Town.

00:00:03.793 --> 00:00:06.410
It started with a fairly ordinary problem.

00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:08.789
I often have several AI sessions open.

00:00:08.789 --> 00:00:11.109
One is changing my training platform,

00:00:11.109 --> 00:00:13.548
another is drafting a Xiaohongshu post.

00:00:13.548 --> 00:00:14.678
When I come back,

00:00:14.678 --> 00:00:16.284
I have to check each one.

00:00:16.284 --> 00:00:17.770
Where did we leave off?

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:18.960
Who needs a reply?

00:00:19.393 --> 00:00:21.723
So I brought those sessions together.

00:00:21.723 --> 00:00:23.575
Each employee is one session.

00:00:23.575 --> 00:00:26.143
I can check their progress from my phone.

00:00:26.627 --> 00:00:29.032
If I don't feel like checking them one by one,

00:00:29.032 --> 00:00:31.186
I ask the butler what needs my attention.

00:00:31.186 --> 00:00:33.241
It reads the task records and finds the

00:00:33.241 --> 00:00:34.543
sessions waiting for me.

00:00:35.127 --> 00:00:37.301
Here I'm sending the requirements for the

00:00:37.301 --> 00:00:38.615
training status display.

00:00:38.615 --> 00:00:41.042
The original session on my computer continues,

00:00:41.042 --> 00:00:42.710
and I can read the result here.

00:00:45.927 --> 00:00:47.597
For the Xiaohongshu draft,

00:00:47.597 --> 00:00:50.400
I can choose a title and ask for edits in the

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:51.593
same conversation.

00:00:55.727 --> 00:00:58.608
I'm also trying out ongoing follow-up.

00:00:58.608 --> 00:01:00.481
I set a goal and limits,

00:01:00.481 --> 00:01:03.722
then enable replies if I want the butler to

00:01:03.722 --> 00:01:04.587
send them.

00:01:04.587 --> 00:01:06.676
It stops when it is unsure,

00:01:06.676 --> 00:01:08.477
and I check the result.

00:01:08.927 --> 00:01:10.409
That part still needs work.

00:01:10.409 --> 00:01:12.708
I'd like to spend less time digging through

00:01:12.708 --> 00:01:14.343
chats and watching every task.
